    "text": "1 days ago The UCLA Bruins, coached by Cori Close, will be featured on a famous TV host’s talk show following the biggest accomplishment in their program’s history. On Sunday, the Bruins, led by the likes of Lauren Betts, won their program its first national title after defeating Coach Dawn Staley’s South Carolina Gamecocks in neutral territory, the Mortgage Matchup Center in Phoenix, Arizona. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
